A0:{reading:'Read the short text. Match familiar words with people, objects, and everyday actions.',writing:'Write words, labels, and very short sentences. Use the model and complete each sentence.',speaking:'Say short phrases aloud. Use the model, then personalize it with your own information.',listening:'Listen for familiar words, names, numbers, and simple instructions.',grammar:'be, subject pronouns, articles, basic questions',vocab:'everyday words, names, numbers, classroom language'},
